**Theme: "Proactive Optimization from a Position of Strength"**

> *"Stellar Labs is currently in a highly stable financial position, backed by $1.2M in cash reserves and a healthy 20-month runway. Our recent quarter generated $670K in revenue, validating our market traction and business model. While our current monthly burn rate of $62K is highly manageable, our objective for the upcoming cycles is to proactively optimize our operations. By strategically reducing non-essential costs and focusing on high-ROI revenue expansion, we aim to extend our runway even further. This disciplined approach ensures we remain resilient against market fluctuations and are perfectly positioned to scale sustainably without the immediate pressure of external fundraising."*

