**Resource Management:**
*   **Strategic Hiring:** Freeze or delay non-essential hires. Focus on internal upskilling or use contractors/freelancers for short-term projects instead of taking on full-time payroll burdens.
*   **Real Estate/Office Space:** If your team is hybrid or remote, consider downsizing your physical office footprint or subleasing unused space.

