*   **Marketing ROI Pruning:** Review your customer acquisition cost (CAC) by channel. Pause the bottom 20% of your marketing spend that isn't converting efficiently and reallocate a portion of it to your top-performing channels.
*   **Contractors over Full-Time Hires:** For upcoming projects, consider hiring specialized freelancers or agencies instead of adding full-time headcount. This keeps your fixed payroll costs down and maintains flexibility.

